// generated by tools/levelgen/raid_bras_droit.py), the run of an instance of up to 8 players in
// lockstep (the same digest on every computer, through the relay in raid mode), the change of
// zone (each player's hearts, powers and presence kept, at the zone's place), the seats that are
// vacant, freed after 60 s, or taken by a late join, and the branch's state given at a step.
